MCELOG - CPU platform support check
-----------------------------------
The test require the Kernel to be compiled with the following config's

for MCELOG test:

CONFIG_X86_MCE
CONFIG_X86_MCELOG_LEGACY
CONFIG_X86_MCE_INJECT

Test Script for MCELOG:
mcelog_model_support_check.c
